<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch PTT '96 results per sector breakdown.</title>
<headline>Dutch PTT '96 results per sector breakdown.</headline>
<dateline>GRONINGEN, Netherlands 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Koninklijke PTT Nederland NV (KPN) 1996 operating profit and sales</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated).</p>
<p>PTT POST</p>
<p>    - turnover (billions)		     6.71  vs    6.08</p>
<p>    - operating profit			943     vs  721</p>
<p>    - profit after taxes		    636     vs  541</p>
<p>PTT Telecom</p>
<p>    - turnover (billions)		    14.28  vs   13.62</p>
<p>    - operating profit (billions)	   3.46  vs    3.18</p>
<p>    - profit after taxes (billions)	 1.77  vs    1.58</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
